[node name="body" type="RichTextLabel" parent="update guide"]
layout_mode = 0
offset_left = 57.0
offset_top = 60.0
offset_right = 506.0
offset_bottom = 306.0
theme_override_fonts/normal_font = ExtResource("3_p5weo")
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 8
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[wave] Welcome to Lm 
v 3.5.4/v 3.6.5[/wave]
in this update the following changed

Changelog:

 -Account System(does not work on web)

 -Screenshots

 -new settings option: Show timer
 
-windows 10 and 11 download options
 
-leaderboard system

-email added to account system

to add a score to the leaderboard first go to [img]res://assets/settings.png[/img] settings and click on the Show Timer button.
Then start a level you should see a timer in the corner of your screen. When you get back to the base walk over to the button that says \"SUBMIT\", click it. if you are not signed in, sign in(you can't submit scores on web because the accounts dont work there).Then once you sign in you should see your time click submit. You submitted your score!

To see other peoples scores on web go to the [img=16x16]res://assets/clock.png[/img] leaderboard then select \"Skip And Just See Scores​\"

To make a screenshot press control + p (this might crash your game on web)

Online Changelog Link:
[url=https://magooster1000.itch.io/l-m-superheroes-v21/devlog/1123293/lm-update-354]CLICK ME[/url]


this post was written on 11/24/25 at 7:15




"
horizontal_alignment = 1

